# Scrollable Shapes — ~3000 points morphing between sphere, cube, torus and
# heart, rotated and perspective-projected in a worklet every frame (recorded
# into a Skia Picture with drawPoints), driven by an invisible paged
# horizontal ScrollView; a paginator's dots stretch with the scroll.
# What this test covers: paging through all four shapes and back, half
# drags held between two shapes (mid-morph lerp while rotating), released
# before the snap point, overscroll past the first and last shape (t clamped,
# negative offsets), fast flings both ways, and a fling stopped by a touch;
# plus letting the rotation run between steps.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/scrollable-shapes"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait 2000
swipe 330 450 60 450
wait 1200
swipe 330 450 60 450
wait 1200
swipe 330 450 60 450
wait 1200
# Past the last shape.
gesture pan 380 450 -300 0 500
wait 1200
# Back to the first, then past it.
swipe 60 450 340 450
wait 1000
swipe 60 450 340 450
wait 1000
swipe 60 450 340 450
wait 1200
gesture pan 20 450 300 0 500
wait 1200
# Half drag held mid-morph, released before the snap point.
gesture pan 300 450 -190 0 2000
wait 1200
gesture pan 300 450 -100 0 1200
wait 1200
# Fast flings and a fling stopped by a touch.
gesture pan 380 450 -360 0 120
wait 1200
gesture pan 20 450 360 0 120
wait 1200
swipe 380 450 20 450
wait 100
press 200 450
wait 1500
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
